{"id":"a59aab1599221f4a","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-system-f.md","title":"System F","display":"df-system-f — System F","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-system-f","aliases":["72-df-system-f"],"display":"df-system-f — System F","depends_on":["[[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]","[[72-df-types-inference-closure]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf, ch.11 print81–94; Handbook V print394–397/PDF406–409 (related polymorphic functional system, not identical syntax)","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local structural construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"review_2026_10_23_comprehensive":"以有限函数图显式构造Ctx及类型判断载体，保持原typing规则"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-system-f"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-system-f</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-system-f — System F"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" href=\"?note=3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" title=\"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction\">72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a77f51439d01d542\" href=\"?note=a77f51439d01d542\" title=\"72-df-types-inference-closure\">72-df-types-inference-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), <a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>, ch.11 print81–94; Handbook V print394–397/PDF406–409 (related polymorphic functional system, not identical syntax)"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"review_2026_10_23_comprehensive","html":"以有限函数图显式构造Ctx及类型判断载体，保持原typing规则"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" href=\"?note=3cb0b5b1c6108aea\" title=\"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction\">72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_t,V_T\">\\(V_t,V_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FTV}\">\\(\\operatorname{FTV}\\)</span>、两种避免捕获代入与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_F\">\\(\\beta_F\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma:V_t\\rightharpoonup\\mathsf{Ty}_F\">\\(\\Gamma:V_t\\rightharpoonup\\mathsf{Ty}_F\\)</span> 为有限偏函数。全部类型为开放类型，不设置额外kind层；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\)</span> 才可扩充。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_F=\\operatorname{Ctx}_F\\times\\Lambda_F\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_F\">\\(U_F=\\operatorname{Ctx}_F\\times\\Lambda_F\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_F\\)</span>；所有图式均遍历合法类型及项。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cl}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cl}\\)</span> 及分数编码使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a77f51439d01d542\" href=\"?note=a77f51439d01d542\" title=\"72-df-types-inference-closure\">72-df-types-inference-closure</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ctx}_F\">\\(\\operatorname{Ctx}_F\\)</span> 在下式直接构造为到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_F\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_F\\)</span> 的有限函数图集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_F\">\\(U_F\\)</span> 从这个集合构造。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_n,L_n,\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r},\\Lambda_F^{\\mathrm r}\">\\(T_n,L_n,\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r},\\Lambda_F^{\\mathrm r}\\)</span> 只含原始树。原始项的类型注解和类型应用参数取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}\\)</span>；先构造原始项，再按上游的原始 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=_\\alpha\">\\(=_\\alpha\\)</span> 取商。规则中的类型、项及构造子均取上游已定义的诱导商运算；变量处于项或类型位置时表示其单变量树的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 类。分数中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\)</span> 使用下式的三元组编码。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT_0&amp;:=V_T,\\\\\nT_{n+1}&amp;:=T_n\\cup\\{A\\to B:A,B\\in T_n\\}\\cup\\{\\forall U.A:U\\in V_T,A\\in T_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}T_n,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Ty}_F:=\\{[A]_\\alpha:A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}\\},\\\\\nL_0&amp;:=V_t,\\\\\nL_{n+1}&amp;:=L_n\\cup\\{MN:M,N\\in L_n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\lambda x:A.M:x\\in V_t,A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r},M\\in L_n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\Lambda U.M:U\\in V_T,M\\in L_n\\}\\cup\\{M[A]:M\\in L_n,A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}\\},\\\\\n\\Lambda_F^{\\mathrm r}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}L_n,\\qquad\\Lambda_F:=\\{[M]_\\alpha:M\\in\\Lambda_F^{\\mathrm r}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ctx}_F&amp;:=\\{g\\subseteq V_t\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_F:g:\\operatorname{dom}(g)\\to\\mathsf{Ty}_F\\land|\\operatorname{dom}(g)|&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\nU_F&amp;:=\\operatorname{Ctx}_F\\times\\Lambda_F\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_F,\\qquad\n(\\Gamma\\vdash M:A):=\\langle\\Gamma,M,A\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT_0&amp;:=V_T,\\\\\nT_{n+1}&amp;:=T_n\\cup\\{A\\to B:A,B\\in T_n\\}\\cup\\{\\forall U.A:U\\in V_T,A\\in T_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}T_n,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Ty}_F:=\\{[A]_\\alpha:A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}\\},\\\\\nL_0&amp;:=V_t,\\\\\nL_{n+1}&amp;:=L_n\\cup\\{MN:M,N\\in L_n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\lambda x:A.M:x\\in V_t,A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r},M\\in L_n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\Lambda U.M:U\\in V_T,M\\in L_n\\}\\cup\\{M[A]:M\\in L_n,A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}\\},\\\\\n\\Lambda_F^{\\mathrm r}&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}L_n,\\qquad\\Lambda_F:=\\{[M]_\\alpha:M\\in\\Lambda_F^{\\mathrm r}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ctx}_F&amp;:=\\{g\\subseteq V_t\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_F:g:\\operatorname{dom}(g)\\to\\mathsf{Ty}_F\\land|\\operatorname{dom}(g)|&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\nU_F&amp;:=\\operatorname{Ctx}_F\\times\\Lambda_F\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_F,\\qquad\n(\\Gamma\\vdash M:A):=\\langle\\Gamma,M,A\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR_F:=&amp;\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash x:A}:x\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\land\\Gamma(x)=A\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\to B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash N:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash MN:B}\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash M:B}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x:A.M:A\\to B}:x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\Lambda U.M:\\forall U.A}:U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\forall U.A}{\\Gamma\\vdash M[B]:A[B/U]}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_F M:A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle\\Gamma,M,A\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_F}(R_F),\\\\\n\\lambda_2&amp;:=\\langle\\mathsf{Ty}_F,\\Lambda_F,\\vdash_F,\\beta_F\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR_F:=&amp;\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash x:A}:x\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\land\\Gamma(x)=A\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\to B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash N:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash MN:B}\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash M:B}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x:A.M:A\\to B}:x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\Lambda U.M:\\forall U.A}:U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\forall U.A}{\\Gamma\\vdash M[B]:A[B/U]}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_F M:A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle\\Gamma,M,A\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_F}(R_F),\\\\\n\\lambda_2&amp;:=\\langle\\mathsf{Ty}_F,\\Lambda_F,\\vdash_F,\\beta_F\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>全称消去允许任意System F类型，包括含全称的类型；全称引入的特征变量条件明确限制整个上下文。项级和类型级β均纳入兼容归约。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"3cb0b5b1c6108aea","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-types-inference-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a77f51439d01d542","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-types-inference-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"3cb0b5b1c6108aea","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]] 的 $V_t,V_T$、$\\operatorname{FTV}$、两种避免捕获代入与 $\\beta_F$。$\\Gamma:V_t\\rightharpoonup\\mathsf{Ty}_F$ 为有限偏函数。全部类型为开放类型，不设置额外kind层；$x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma$ 才可扩充。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-types-inference-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a77f51439d01d542","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U_F=\\operatorname{Ctx}_F\\times\\Lambda_F\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_F$；所有图式均遍历合法类型及项。$\\operatorname{Cl}$ 及分数编码使用 [[72-df-types-inference-closure]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"V_t,V_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FTV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma:V_t\\rightharpoonup\\mathsf{Ty}_F","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"U_F=\\operatorname{Ctx}_F\\times\\Lambda_F\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ctx}_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_F","display":false},{"tex":"U_F","display":false},{"tex":"T_n,L_n,\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r},\\Lambda_F^{\\mathrm r}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}","display":false},{"tex":"=_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash M:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nT_0&:=V_T,\\\\\nT_{n+1}&:=T_n\\cup\\{A\\to B:A,B\\in T_n\\}\\cup\\{\\forall U.A:U\\in V_T,A\\in T_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}&:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}T_n,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Ty}_F:=\\{[A]_\\alpha:A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}\\},\\\\\nL_0&:=V_t,\\\\\nL_{n+1}&:=L_n\\cup\\{MN:M,N\\in L_n\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\lambda x:A.M:x\\in V_t,A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r},M\\in L_n\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\Lambda U.M:U\\in V_T,M\\in L_n\\}\\cup\\{M[A]:M\\in L_n,A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}\\},\\\\\n\\Lambda_F^{\\mathrm r}&:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}L_n,\\qquad\\Lambda_F:=\\{[M]_\\alpha:M\\in\\Lambda_F^{\\mathrm r}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ctx}_F&:=\\{g\\subseteq V_t\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_F:g:\\operatorname{dom}(g)\\to\\mathsf{Ty}_F\\land|\\operatorname{dom}(g)|<\\omega\\},\\\\\nU_F&:=\\operatorname{Ctx}_F\\times\\Lambda_F\\times\\mathsf{Ty}_F,\\qquad\n(\\Gamma\\vdash M:A):=\\langle\\Gamma,M,A\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nR_F:=&\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\Gamma\\vdash x:A}:x\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\land\\Gamma(x)=A\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\to B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash N:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash MN:B}\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash M:B}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x:A.M:A\\to B}:x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:A}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\Lambda U.M:\\forall U.A}:U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:\\forall U.A}{\\Gamma\\vdash M[B]:A[B/U]}\\right\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_F M:A&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\langle\\Gamma,M,A\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_F}(R_F),\\\\\n\\lambda_2&:=\\langle\\mathsf{Ty}_F,\\Lambda_F,\\vdash_F,\\beta_F\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3704,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本轮修订：[[72-df-curry-howard]] · [[72-thm-curry-howard-isomorphism]] · [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]] · [[72-df-system-f]]；新增：[[72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex]]。"},{"id":"4628a763a7cdff3f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s\\in\\{\\to,F\\}$；类型、项、原始项集合 $\\Lambda_s^{\\mathrm r}$ 与商上的两种代入分别使用 [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]、[[72-df-system-f]]。原始类型集在 $s=\\to$ 时取 $\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to$，在 $s=F$ 时取 $\\mathsf{Ty}_F^{\\mathrm r}$；$\\kappa_s$ 是下式的原始类型到公共类型接口的映射。命题语法就是相应类型语法。"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本轮修订：[[72-df-curry-howard]] · [[72-thm-curry-howard-isomorphism]] · [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]] · [[72-df-system-f]]；新增：[[72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex]]。"},{"id":"c1cc99c8ec1e8071","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"类型与项取 [[72-df-system-f]]；$U\\in V_T$，$f,x\\in V_t$ 互异，$n\\in\\omega$。$F,X\\in\\Lambda_F$ 是迭代输入项；所有绑定项按既定 α 类读取。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本轮修订：[[72-df-curry-howard]] · [[72-thm-curry-howard-isomorphism]] · [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]] · [[72-df-system-f]]；新增：[[72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex]]。"},{"id":"6061af339630925b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma,\\Lambda_F,\\mathsf{Ty}_F,\\vdash_F$、项及类型的避免捕获替换取 [[72-df-system-f]] 与 [[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]。"},{"id":"99aa8943f30c6e5e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\vdash_{F}M:A$、合法项集与 $\\beta_F$ 取自 [[72-df-system-f]]。$\\operatorname{SN}_R$ 与 $\\operatorname{Normal}_R$ 见 [[72-df-normalization-proof]]。"},{"id":"06b025d5c611f287","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma,\\vdash_F,\\beta_F,\\Lambda_F$ 同 [[72-df-system-f]]；$\\beta_F$ 同时含项应用收缩与类型应用收缩。"}],"outgoing":["3cb0b5b1c6108aea","a77f51439d01d542"]}